<table border=0 width=100% cellspacing=0>
<tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white>Raid Suggestion</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by  on 2000-11-22 08:35:48</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>The inhabitants of Castle Mistmoore have been using the guise of the Tier'Dal long enough! I find it high time to flush them out like the dogs they are and expose their true identities! I propose a raid on Castle Mistmoore. It will allow Kementari or any other rogues who need it, the Blood Spirits...as well as good opportunity for Shamans to exterminate the Dire wolf. There are many other fine items to be "aquired" from the mansion too. I would suggest Seasons 20 and up. Near the entrance are Black Burrow like trains of Familiars, ripe for the picking. While our higher seasons can raid the Mansion and Crypts for the 40+ Beasts. I should think great experience, constand fights, and excellant loot opportunities make this a great place for a raid. It can easily be reached by Teleport to Gfay, not far from Lfay entrance. Binding can also be done anywhere in Gfay as well. I hope this opportunity doesn't get passed up. Thanks ^_^</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

<tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=892&lastnode_id=888">Re: Raid Suggestion</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=215&lastnode_id=888">Razze</a> on 2000-11-22 19:23:44</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>I have always wanted to hunt Mist Moore, but I was never sure where I could got bound, being a dark elf shadow knight. Also if we can have it set up to get teleported in to the area that is great. I hate having to jump off the boat and swim in to avoid the army of guards. Anyway I like the idea, count me in.<br>
<br>
Razze</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=893&lastnode_id=888">Re: Raid Suggestion</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=192&lastnode_id=888">Runja</a> on 2000-11-23 16:10:59</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Me believes dat weez can bind peeple at da outskirts of Kelethin in GFay.  Juss listen fer da elfie muzic (ooc - when you enter the city "area" you will hear music) and yooz can bind dere.  So, ya weez can bind peeple close to Mistmoore.<br>
<br>
