OOC:<br>
Mistmoor is real fun)  its got a lvl 20 to 27 section near the zone and lake area. a lvl 30 to 40 section at the grave yard and pit area.  and a lvl 40 up section inside the castle. and oh boy is that castle tough.  all we need is 2 groups, each with a chanter though. the chanter is the key because even with a monk the pulls will be big(the mobs aggro bad there, the pathing is messed up so they run all over the castle before following you).<br>
  one of the worst things about the castle is the negotiater, shes a chanter.  Last time she charmed cancy's pet, me, and a 48 SK that i forget the name of, and us charmed peeple combined with the big pull basicaly got us all killed hehe.  but once we get the castle under controll it will be much easier.<br>
<br>
Oh, and you DONT have to get close to the elfy city, the ENTIRE zone is considered a city zone. So, all you have to do is get right up to the zone to lesserfey and bind there, so its even closer to mm and theres never any guards there.  all the porters are safe, the wizzy porter has no guards and its right by lesserfey so its the best one to port to, the 2 druid ones are in butcher and steamfont, but thay are safe too, at least to my troll. theres just merchants there, no druids.<br>
